cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this portfolio, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Digital Heritage Portfolio"
abstract: >-
  Research software for digital heritage and the humanities: reconstruction
  pipelines for 3D/4D records, linked-data models with SHACL validation,
  knowledge-graph exploration and recommendation, and interfaces that keep
  computational results connected to their sources, paradata and uncertainty.
  Includes a test suite and reproducibility packages for published results.
